  "text": "AFK Hermod\n\n​\nDisclaimer\n⬥ IF YOU CANNOT GET A METHOD TO WORK DO NOT MESSAGE THE CREATOR(S).\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• It is more than likely user error or cutting corners, use #pvm-help if you cannot get it to work.\n​\nPositioning\n\n⬥ Enter instance,  and take 2 more steps forward.\n​\nNecromancy AFK Method (55+ kph) \nOverview\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work:\n    • Cutting corners will result in failure.\n    • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel.\n\nItems\n⬥ Salve amulet (e) \n⬥ Cinderbane gloves \n⬥ Weapon poison+++ \n⬥ Kwuarm incense sticks \n⬥ Powder of Penance \n⬥ Igneous Kal-Mor  or Igneous Kal-Zuk \nAbilities\n⬥ Command Vengeful Ghost \n    • Only required for high-level setup with minion skips.\n⬥ Spectral Scythe (Cast 3) \n    • Only required for low-level setup without minion skips.\nOther\n⬥ Darkness \n    • Only required for low-level setup without minion skips.\n⬥ Holy Scarab \n    • Doesn't require scrolls.\n⬥ Undead Slayer perk \n    • Ideally paired with regular dps perks.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n​\nPresets and Relics \n​\n⬥ Necromancy - Low-level \n⬥ Necromancy - High-level \n​\n⬥ A low-level preset (~47 KPH) is provided for when minions cannot (yet) be skipped:\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• Use  to help with survivability.\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• If  is not required for survival you can use  instead.\n⬥ The First Necromancer gear (+  ) can also be used for similar KPH.\n⬥ Using  over  is a small KPH increase.\n​\n\nAction Bars \n⬥ High-level: minion skips\n\n⬥ Low-level: without minion skips\n\n ‎‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• If healing is an issue, put  before \n​\nKPH \n⬥ At Level 120  one can expect ~40s kill times and ~55 KPH with the high-level method.\n⬥ The low-level method yields ~47 KPH with t90 weapons, t80 power armour and Level 90 ; assuming the method requirements are met.\n​\nExample Kills \n⬥ High-level Hermod example\n​\n      \n    ",
  "normalizedText": "AFK Hermod ​ Disclaimer ⬥ IF YOU CANNOT GET A METHOD TO WORK DO NOT MESSAGE THE CREATOR(S). ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• It is more than likely user error or cutting corners, use #pvm-help if you cannot get it to work. ​ Positioning ⬥ Enter instance, and take 2 more steps forward. ​ Necromancy AFK Method (55+ kph) Overview ⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work: • Cutting corners will result in failure. • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel. Items ⬥ Salve amulet (e) ⬥ Cinderbane gloves ⬥ Weapon poison+++ ⬥ Kwuarm incense sticks ⬥ Powder of Penance ⬥ Igneous Kal-Mor or Igneous Kal-Zuk Abilities ⬥ Command Vengeful Ghost • Only required for high-level setup with minion skips. ⬥ Spectral Scythe (Cast 3) • Only required for low-level setup without minion skips. Other ⬥ Darkness • Only required for low-level setup without minion skips. ⬥ Holy Scarab • Doesn't require scrolls. ⬥ Undead Slayer perk • Ideally paired with regular dps perks. ​ Presets and Relics ​ ⬥ Necromancy - Low-level ⬥ Necromancy - High-level ​ ⬥ A low-level preset (~47 KPH) is provided for when minions cannot (yet) be skipped: ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• Use to help with survivability. ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• If is not required for survival you can use instead. ⬥ The First Necromancer gear (+ ) can also be used for similar KPH. ⬥ Using over is a small KPH increase. ​ Action Bars ⬥ High-level: minion skips ⬥ Low-level: without minion skips ‎‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• If healing is an issue, put before ​ KPH ⬥ At Level 120 one can expect ~40s kill times and ~55 KPH with the high-level method. ⬥ The low-level method yields ~47 KPH with t90 weapons, t80 power armour and Level 90 ; assuming the method requirements are met. ​ Example Kills ⬥ High-level Hermod example ​",
